{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Snapshot execution input before user code can mutate it**\n\n`executionInput()` is the same mutable object passed to the handler. Caching its reference lets handler mutations rewrite later insight records; in ON_CHANGE mode, a mutating input transform can even alter the object before the handler runs. Create and cache a detached snapshot before applying transforms, use it for every emission including invocation end, and test both handler and transform mutations.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7nh9X2","finding_digest":"1631942f68193bb54172d7056167629cbeebdae5c9ed26dd8a36c11640151c75","finding_id":"arf_v1_cyyzil3ide53kqls24cwcz3cts","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::execution-input-snapshot-isolation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::execution-input-snapshot-isolation","line":105,"observation_digest":"d42de5b9e3761a2f508554ccea6843b91787b0118e5ffcb0d9fedce7d0feba36","observation_id":"aro_v1_2qw6lopdoync6uefktgou2cdxe","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5xididmhluq4mhdhugntjpm257","reviewed_base_sha":"6501c39f553655583e33238eb1d821e4f44b8e26","reviewed_head_sha":"bdbd88fcdf777f50567d968c0e73fa11c8eb39ad","reviewer":"codex","start_line":105,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_xb5hbzsayv7trarpt5ovc6xaft","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
